  "body": "Noticed that FNA unit tests fail on SM86 because it can't handle any configs with a 64x128x128 GEMM tile size. Obviously due to shared memory limits and how SM80 and 86 share all their kernels but there's a huge disparity between A100/H100 (SM80 and SM90) and the rest of the GPUs in their respective generations (SM86 and SM89).\r\n\r\nWhile I can't test SM89, I'm disabling the overly-large GEMM config for both just to be safe until we can test SM89, but I'm relatively confident that SM89 won't be able to handle the same config.",
  "created_at": "2024-03-16T02:06:28Z",
  "updated_at": "2024-03-16T02:50:58Z",
